{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04927","headline":"饯许州宋司马赴任 · 卢藏用","name":"饯许州宋司马赴任","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"国爲休徵选，舆因仲举题。\n山川襄野隔，朋酒灞亭暌。\n零雨征轩骛，秋风别骥嘶。\n骊歌一曲罢，愁望正凄凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢藏用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04927.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04927","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}